WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.799
Ricky: Wow! Look at all the snow!

2
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:10.548
Mom, can I play outside?

3
00:00:10.549 --> 00:00:19.765
Mom: After breakfast, Ricky.

4
00:00:19.766 --> 00:00:23.805
Brian: Hello. This is Brian Rabbit!

5
00:00:23.806 --> 00:00:26.384
Ricky: Hey, Brian. It’s Ricky.

6
00:00:26.385 --> 00:00:30.128
I’m going to the park. Can you come?

7
00:00:30.129 --> 00:00:38.274
Brian: Yes, I can. See you there.

8
00:00:38.275 --> 00:00:43.579
Brenda: Hey, Ricky! What are you

9
00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:47.384
doing? Ricky: Hi, Brenda. I’m making a snow

10
00:00:47.385 --> 00:00:55.270
angel. It’s fun. You should try.

11
00:00:55.271 --> 00:00:58.012
Let’s go to the park.

12
00:00:58.013 --> 00:01:00.950
We can make a snowman. Brenda:

13
00:01:00.951 --> 00:01:06.080
Great! Ricky:

14
00:01:06.081 --> 00:01:08.880
Good to see you, Brian.

15
00:01:08.881 --> 00:01:11.483
Let’s build a snowman. Brian:

16
00:01:11.484 --> 00:01:16.871
Okay, Ricky. Brenda:

17
00:01:16.872 --> 00:01:19.555
What are you doing, Ricky? Ricky:

18
00:01:19.556 --> 00:01:29.924
Watch and see. This snowball will get super big!

19
00:01:29.925 --> 00:01:32.777
Brenda: Ricky, are you okay?

20
00:01:32.778 --> 00:01:38.445
Ricky: Brrrrr! I’m okay, just a little cold.

21
00:01:38.446 --> 00:01:41.286
Brian: Don’t do that

22
00:01:41.287 --> 00:01:45.552
again! The snowman needs something . . .

23
00:01:45.553 --> 00:01:50.583
Ricky: I have an idea. But I have to run

24
00:01:50.584 --> 00:01:56.112
home. Just wait a minute.

